[00:23.66]Into the distance, a ribbon of black
[00:23.66]远方的黑色条带
[00:29.06]Stretched to the point of no turning back
[00:29.06]延伸到那无人归来的世界
[00:34.85]A flight of fancy on a windswept field
[00:34.85]幻想在风中的田野飞翔
[00:40.24]Standing alone my senses reeled
[00:40.24]独自站在那里，我的思绪翻飞
[00:46.22]A fatal attraction holding me fast, how
[00:46.22]它致命的吸引力越来越无法抗拒
[00:51.45]Can I escape this irresistible grasp?
[00:51.45]何以逃脱？
[00:57.81]Can't keep my eyes from the circling skies
[00:57.81]我的眼睛离不开那片天空
[01:03.22]Tongue-tied and twisted Just an earth-bound misfit, I
[01:03.22]我沉默，我苦恼，因为这命运的枷锁，我
[01:21.13]Ice is forming on the tips of my wings
[01:21.13]我的双翼被寒冰覆盖
[01:26.45]Unheeded warnings, I thought I thought of everything
[01:26.45]我无所畏惧，我觉得我了解所有事物
[01:32.13]No navigator to found my way home
[01:32.13]我从没打算回头
[01:37.93]Unladened, empty and turned to stone
[01:37.93]回去做一块空虚的石头
[01:43.85]A soul in tension that's learning to fly
[01:43.85]我的灵魂正在学习飞翔
[01:49.24]Condition grounded but determined to try
[01:49.24]生于大地却想展翅翱翔
[01:55.04]Can't keep my eyes from the circling skies
[01:55.04]我的眼睛紧紧盯着那片天空
[02:00.68]Tongue-tied and twisted just an earth-bound misfit, I
[02:00.68]我说不出话，我的心里挣扎，因为我不肯相信命运，我
